OL,3,GNEWSAOysters from nursery 'thriving' in
OL,4,ANorth Sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the past six years, the Zoological
OL,7,FSociety of London (ZSL) and nature
OL,8,Fcharity Groundwork North East and
OL,9,FCumbria have been establishing
OL,10,Fself-sustaining, functioning oyster
OL,11,Freefs in Sunderland and off the
OL,12,FWhitburn coast.
OL,14,FZSL project manager Celine Gamble said:
OL,15,F"Thousands of oysters are currently
OL,16,Fthriving in the conditions and
OL,17,Fhopefully we will soon see the
OL,18,Fbiodiversity benefits they can bring."
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
